Microsoft E7
https://www.reddit.com/r/sysadmin/comments/1rjmepn/microsoft_365_e7_new_enterprise_licensing_tier/

- Conditional Access policies set to "All resources" with exclusions were not enforced for apps using minimal sign-in scopes
- This gap allowed some sign-ins to bypass security checks like MFA and device compliance
- Starting March 27, 2026, Microsoft will close this loophole across all tenants
- All sign-ins will now be evaluated against Conditional Access policies, regardless of the scope requested
- Most organizations need no action - only custom apps using minimal scopes may need review

